{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54645","headline":"兵要望江南 占雷第九（京本列第二十五○三十一首） 二十五 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占雷第九（京本列第二十五○三十一首） 二十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兵发日，须要识鸣方。\n雷自我军营上起，主军大胜客军伤，天意助吾祥。\n（以下七首从京本补。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54645.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54645","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}